  "description": "One day, the Son of God came to the school. Her name is Go Deung Shin. Since her arrival, Go Deung Shin has shown many miracles, such as raising a sitting person, knocking down the school’s bully, reviving the dead, and other such miracles. Bae Du Hong, a loser at school, was reborn by Go Deung Shin, and he fights as the first apostle to prove the miracles of Go Deung Shin. But is she, or is he really the son of God? Or… \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
